  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Copy script <b>name</b> into <b>target</b> and set to <b>running</b> with a <b>start_param</b> only if <b>target</b>'s <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetRemoteScriptAccessPin" target="_blank">pin</a> matches <b>pin</b></p>
</p>
