  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p>History</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Added in 1.2.6</li>
    <li>In SL 1.25.4 this function will not copy/move any script into an attachment unless the script is full perm. (<a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-3725" target="_blank">SVC-3725</a>)</li>
    <li>SL 1.25.5 will allow this function to copy/move a script into an attachment so long as the target has matching (or more restrictive) copy and transfer permissions. (<a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-3738" target="_blank">SVC-3738</a>)</li>
  </ul>
